# The release manifest hashes working-tree bytes, so line endings must be
# identical on every platform. Without `eol=lf`, a checkout on a machine with
# core.autocrlf=true yields CRLF, and every text-file SHA-256 recorded in
# results/v0.3.7_release_manifest.json then fails to reproduce.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.whl binary

